    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31158" root="عيب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عائِبٌ</span></b>  part. n. of the intrans. v. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَابَ</span>; [i. e.
<i>Being,</i> or <i>becoming, faulty,</i> &amp;c.;] applied to an
article of merchandise [&amp;c.]. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And also
act. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَابَهُ</span>. (Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, applied to
milk, <i>Thick,</i> or <i>becoming thick.</i> (O, K.)

